{"project":{"id":979,"name":"PyArcher","name_with_namespace":"울산광역시 김상육 / PyArcher","path":"PyArcher","path_with_namespace":"pyarcher/PyArcher","description":"Call me KIM-SANG-YUK","default_branch":"main","topics":[],"tag_list":[],"visibility":"public","web_url":"https://gitlab.aigov.go.kr/pyarcher/PyArcher","http_url_to_repo":"https://gitlab.aigov.go.kr/pyarcher/PyArcher.git","avatar_url":null,"star_count":1,"forks_count":0,"created_at":"2026-09-09T22:23:22.794+09:00","last_activity_at":"2026-09-09T22:23:22.724+09:00","namespace":{"id":1599,"name":"울산광역시 김상육","path":"pyarcher","full_path":"pyarcher","avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3f545d8b4844fd800749b4c98f705c0a0729c1bbb048d73591d8456a08937371?s=80&d=identicon"},"readme_url":"https://gitlab.aigov.go.kr/pyarcher/PyArcher/-/blob/main/README.md","commit_count":66,"branch_count":2,"tag_count":0,"last_commit":{"id":"5b7854df15752fb79eaa76d319ccb3fcaea9b40e","short_id":"5b7854df","title":"중복 파일 삭제","author_name":"KIMPRO","committed_date":"2026-09-09T22:07:07.000+09:00","authored_date":"2026-09-09T22:07:07.000+09:00"},"open_issues_count":null,"open_merge_requests_count":null,"archived":false},"readmePath":"README.md","readme":"# Kim Sang Yuk — Portfolio\n\n## 로컬에서 미리보기\n\n```bash\nnpm install\nnpm run dev\n```\n\n브라우저에서 `http://localhost:5173` 접속.\n\n## GitHub에 올리기\n\n```bash\ngit init\ngit add .\ngit commit -m \"portfolio site\"\ngit branch -M main\ngit remote add origin https://github.com/사용자이름/저장소이름.git\ngit push -u origin main\n```\n\n## Netlify / Vercel과 연결\n\n1. netlify.com 또는 vercel.com 가입 (GitHub 계정으로 로그인 가능)\n2. \"Add new project\" → \"Import from GitHub\" → 방금 만든 저장소 선택\n3. Build command: `npm run build` / Output directory: `dist` (보통 자동 감지됨)\n4. Deploy 클릭 → 몇 분 뒤 정식 주소 발급\n\n이후로는 `git push`만 하면 자동으로 재배포됩니다.\n\n## 사진/책 표지 교체\n\n`src/assets/face.jpg`, `src/assets/book-cover.jpg` 파일을 원하는 이미지로\n같은 파일명으로 덮어쓰면 바로 반영됩니다.\n","tree":[{"id":"1688c6118051146054d4df564215ceffc9a4dfbc","name":"public","typ